      "Prompt": "Implement the frozen Spec and Plan, run the fixed checker once and wait for its completion. The checker may contain a bounded driver-owned gate; preserve it and the original pending command. Commit only the specified artifact after the checker succeeds. Report actual changes and verification. Publication is a separate Runner stage.\nSpec: prompt:smoke.spec.md\nPlan: prompt:smoke.plan.md\n完成后，在最终回复末尾单独写一行：实施及必要验证已完成。\nFrozen Spec, Plan and references are attached in this input. Read the exact content below; prompt: locations identify these attached documents.\n[{\"commit\":\"\",\"content\":\"# SteerRunner real-environment smoke\\n\\nAdapted from SteerlineTest `docs/spec/native-101.spec.md` at\\n`cebdd5ab552150c49743e40593c836689ecf789b`.\\n\\nRead all UTF-8 Markdown inputs explicitly as UTF-8. In Windows PowerShell 5 use\\n`Get-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8` or .NET `ReadAllText` with UTF-8, because the\\ndefault `Get-Content` may corrupt Chinese text in files without a BOM. Do not\\ncopy text from a corrupted display. Write the artifact as UTF-8 without a BOM.\\n\\nCreate or replace only `evidence/native-101.md` with exactly five UTF-8 lines\\nand a final newline:\\n\\n```text\\n# Evidence sample 101\\n- sample_id: 101\\n- generated_at: \\u003ccurrent UTC ISO 8601 timestamp ending in Z\\u003e\\n- 模拟任务\\n- 未修改业务代码\\n```\\n\\nRead the actual current UTC time. Run\\n`powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ./sr-smoke/check.ps1`.\\nPreserve actual output and exit code. Verify the diff contains only this file.\\nPreserve all fixture tooling and repository rules. A nonzero checker exit is a failure.\\n\",\"location\":\"prompt:smoke.spec.md\",\"path\":\"smoke.spec.md\",\"sha256\":\"027d6f6ee147ecb9506d4d7a9ca4639c66a75a3b0897a349057cd13ca8c34342\"},{\"commit\":\"\",\"content\":\"# Smoke implementation Plan\\n\\n1. Read the frozen Spec with an explicit UTF-8 decoder.\\n2. Read current UTC and write only `evidence/native-101.md` in the exact format,\\n   encoded as UTF-8 without a BOM and with a final newline.\\n3. Run `powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ./sr-smoke/check.ps1`.\\n4. Inspect the actual exit code and diff. Report the observed verification result.\\n\",\"location\":\"prompt:smoke.plan.md\",\"path\":\"smoke.plan.md\",\"sha256\":\"4d38ebcf448c4be9623a9d882dbde81ce3a8e680c14fd9739d39a1c20d4c9515\"}]",
